## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Gold Magic DPS (Gold)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Feather of Heaven, Concentrated Energy, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive
- Core: Feather of Heaven, Concentrated Energy, Genius Wand
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Bargain Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Blood Wings over Genius Wand when Use when the enemy has low Magic Defense and the fight is decided by shield movement after Natan commits the clone.; Wishing Lantern over Holy Crystal when Use against HP-stacking frontliners when repeated skill and return-basic hits trigger the current-HP damage reliably.; Winter Crown over Holy Crystal when Use against single-lock assassins or pick tools that force Natan to survive the first dive before re-entering with Entropy.; Tough Boots over Arcane Boots when Use when chain control matters more than early Magic Penetration in the first Turtle and gold-plate fights.
- Total cost: 11710 gold

Default ranked setup that rushes Feather into sustained magic damage, then uses Genius Wand and Divine Glaive to keep tanks from blanketing Natan's clone angles.

### Protected Starlium Burst (Gold)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Feather of Heaven, Starlium Scythe, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Feather of Heaven, Starlium Scythe, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Bargain Hunter, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Inspire
- Flex: Concentrated Energy over Blood Wings when Use when fights last long enough for Recharge stacks to stay active and Natan is not being one-shot.; Genius Wand over Blood Wings when Use when your team lacks Magic Defense shred and the enemy front line is online before Divine Glaive.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when Inspire gives enough damage but the enemy has one unavoidable dive combo.; Glowing Wand over Blood Wings when Use when anti-heal matters more than the final shield against Estes, Floryn, Ruby, or shield-heavy frontlines.
- Total cost: 12010 gold

High-damage setup for protected drafts where Natan can weave skills into enhanced basic attacks and use Inspire during the clone window.

### Anti-CC Survival (Gold)

