- Flex: Blood Wings over Winter Crown when Use when the enemy has poke or chase pressure but no single combo that demands stasis.; Athena's Shield over Holy Crystal when Use against instant magic burst that decides the fight before Natan can swap back to the Reverse-Clone.; Radiant Armor over Holy Crystal when Use against repeated magic damage that stacks through long front-to-back fights.; Immortality over Winter Crown when Use for the last Lord setup when revive value is stronger than a stasis active.
- Total cost: 11630 gold

Defensive gold lane setup for CC-heavy drafts after the patch 2.1.67 durability nerf, trading peak burst for Purify, Fortitude, and a late stasis button.

